00:23:17.400 --> 00:23:24.830
Hart Montgomery: So, Trust over IP is a standards org, as they say, an architecture for internet digital trust.

138
00:23:25.580 --> 00:23:31.199
Hart Montgomery: Trust over IP works in the form of working groups, so each of these groups,

139
00:23:32.900 --> 00:23:37.819
Hart Montgomery: works together, and the output is typically some standard.

